[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 362.87, "timestamp": "00:06:02", "text": "大家好。你好。你好。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 365.909, "timestamp": "00:06:05", "text": "呃，我非常抱歉。我在這裡遇到了很大的困難。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 368.07, "timestamp": "00:06:08", "text": "呃，一心多用。 [笑聲與喘息聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 383.27, "timestamp": "00:06:23", "text": "這是我今年第一次合作，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 385.134, "timestamp": "00:06:25", "text": "但我遇到了困難。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 390.309, "timestamp": "00:06:30", "text": "好的，寶貝。兄弟，我整個影片都卡頓了。  你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 393.99, "timestamp": "00:06:33", "text": "，Draganoser。歡迎光臨。您好。  你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 395.83, "timestamp": "00:06:35", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 399.029, "timestamp": "00:06:39", "text": "呃，好的。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 401.749, "timestamp": "00:06:41", "text": "呃，我們這裡遇到了一些技術問題"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 409.67, "timestamp": "00:06:49", "text": "嗨，邁克爾·普內斯。等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 413.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:06:53", "text": "他們準備好了告訴我，然後我就會給他們看。  你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 419.11, "timestamp": "00:06:59", "text": "嗯，我就簡單說一下。"}]